  "ruleText": "Ac 403.03 Continuing Professional Education Audit Procedure. The OPLC shall conduct audits as required by Plc 308.04(d) for compliance with Ac 403.01 and Ac 403.02.\n\nSource. #14322, eff 9-15-25, EXPIRES: 9-15-35",
